OL,3,ATrump threatens new tariffs on Canadian
OL,4,Avehicles after trade talks collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is
OL,7,Fthreatening to impose new tariffs on
OL,8,FCanadian vehicles on 1 January
OL,10,FMeanwhile, Canada's prime minister,
OL,11,FMark Carney, is preparing a response to
OL,12,Ffresh tariffs imposed by the US on
OL,13,FCanadian goods this weekend after trade
OL,14,Ftalks collapsed
OL,16,FCarney confirmed he would match Trump's
OL,17,Ftariffs "dollar-for-dollar" from 8
OL,18,FSeptember, including levies on steel,
OL,19,Fdairy, appliances and electronics
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
